Date: Thu, 21 Nov 2024 12:04:00 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] QSDK:CP:mac80211.sh: Add support to bringin features with
 openwrt upgrade

Add support to bring in the below features
	1) Discard AWGN event
	2) 80 MHz, 160 MHz and 320 MHz EHT ULMUMIMO support
	3) CCFS
	4) RU puncture OFDMA
	5) RU puncture DFS
	6) RU puncture bitmap
	7) RU puncture ACS Threshold
	8) Disable CSA DFS
	9) Radio id support for wds scenario.
	10) Add EHT with 320 Mhz support for repeater-AP.
	11) ML reconfigure from wifi command
	12) PPE VP
	13) BSS color calculation
	14) FQ limit configuration
	15) single wiphy capability string
	16) HE configurations
	17) EHT configurations
	18) smp affinity and performance scripts

Add changes for generating default interface names:
	For non-single wiphy architecture: phy00-ap0, phy00-ap1
	For single wiphy architecture: phy00-2g-ap0, phy00-5g-ap0
	for MLD vaps, phy00-mld1 , where mld1 is the mld name

Also, add changes to set freq_list for mesh and sta config

Co-developed-by: Nagarajan Maran <quic_nmaran@quicinc.com>
Change-Id: I2299484caf0da905d2729d0b9ca7df097baf374f
